{"nodes": [{"id": "pipeline_configure_vm_configurevm", "label": "configureVm", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "lib/pipeline/configure-vm.ts", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "pipeline_configure_vm_configurevm", "label": "configureVm (pipeline in-guest)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "lib/pipeline/configure-vm.ts", "source_location": "L124-254", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tout passe par l'API REST Proxmox \u2014 file-write puis exec puis exec-status, l'\u00e9quivalent de `qm guest exec` : aucun acc\u00e8s SSH \u00e0 l'hyperviseur n'est requis. Ordre impos\u00e9 : d\u00e9marrage, attente de l'agent, d\u00e9p\u00f4t du contexte, scripts."}, {"id": "pipeline_configure_vm_guestpaths", "label": "guestPaths (C:\\ProgramData\\lumiconnect vs /opt/lumiconnect)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "lib/pipeline/configure-vm.ts", "source_location": "L48-60", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "pipeline_configure_vm_preparedirectorycommand", "label": "prepareDirectoryCommand (mkdir + icacls/chmod 700)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "lib/pipeline/configure-vm.ts", "source_location": "L62-79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "agent/file-write n'ouvre pas de fichier dans un r\u00e9pertoire inexistant : il faut le cr\u00e9er avant. Les droits sont restreints dans la foul\u00e9e car le fichier de contexte contient le mot de passe. Les groupes Windows int\u00e9gr\u00e9s portent des noms traduits, donc icacls vise des SID pr\u00e9fix\u00e9s de * (S-1-5-18 SYSTEM, S-1-5-32-544 Administrateurs), universels."}, {"id": "pipeline_configure_vm_restrictcontextcommand", "label": "restrictContextCommand (chmod 600, Linux seulement)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "lib/pipeline/configure-vm.ts", "source_location": "L81-86", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sous Windows les droits pos\u00e9s par icacls sur le r\u00e9pertoire sont h\u00e9rit\u00e9s par le fichier ; sous Linux le fichier na\u00eet avec l'umask du guest agent, d'o\u00f9 un chmod 600 explicite."}, {"id": "pipeline_configure_vm_removecontextcommand", "label": "removeContextCommand (suppression du contexte)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "lib/pipeline/configure-vm.ts", "source_location": "L88-101", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le contexte porte le mot de passe en clair : le laisser sur la machine en ferait un fichier \u00e0 emplacement connu, lisible par quiconque obtient un acc\u00e8s local. La suppression s'ex\u00e9cute quelle que soit l'issue de la boucle de scripts, qui sort par plusieurs chemins d'erreur."}, {"id": "pipeline_configure_vm_context_file", "label": "Fichier de contexte LC_* d\u00e9pos\u00e9 dans l'invit\u00e9", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "lib/pipeline/configure-vm.ts", "source_location": "L146-187", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le contexte est d\u00e9pos\u00e9, pas ex\u00e9cut\u00e9 : les scripts le sourcent eux-m\u00eames. Passer le mot de passe par fichier plut\u00f4t qu'en argument \u00e9vite qu'il apparaisse dans la liste des processus de la VM. Un BOM est ajout\u00e9 c\u00f4t\u00e9 PowerShell pour qu'un mot de passe accentu\u00e9 ne soit pas relu en ANSI."}, {"id": "pipeline_configure_vm_reboot_after", "label": "reboot_after : red\u00e9marrage puis r\u00e9attente de l'agent", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "lib/pipeline/configure-vm.ts", "source_location": "L226-238", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le guest agent dispara\u00eet le temps du red\u00e9marrage : sans r\u00e9attente explicite, le script suivant partirait dans le vide."}, {"id": "pipeline_configure_vm_scriptstep", "label": "scriptStep / scriptSteps (colonnes de progression)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "lib/pipeline/configure-vm.ts", "source_location": "L33-39", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "pipeline_configure_vm_configurevm", "target": "services_proxmox_agent_startvm", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "lib/pipeline/configure-vm.ts", "source_location": "L136", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "pipeline_configure_vm_configurevm", "target": "services_proxmox_agent_waitforagent", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "lib/pipeline/configure-vm.ts", "source_location": "L142", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "pipeline_configure_vm_configurevm", "target": "services_proxmox_agent_runguestcommand", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "lib/pipeline/configure-vm.ts", "source_location": "L149", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "pipeline_configure_vm_configurevm", "target": "services_proxmox_agent_guestfilewrite", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "lib/pipeline/configure-vm.ts", "source_location": "L171", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "pipeline_configure_vm_configurevm", "target": "services_proxmox_agent_runguestscript", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "lib/pipeline/configure-vm.ts", "source_location": "L202", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "pipeline_configure_vm_configurevm", "target": "services_proxmox_agent_rebootvm", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "lib/pipeline/configure-vm.ts", "source_location": "L227", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "pipeline_configure_vm_configurevm", "target": "scripts_escape_rendercontextfile", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "conf